WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:06.043
The writing assistant

2
00:00:06.552 --> 00:00:16.684
The writing assistant uses the AI you choose: Claude, ChatGPT or OpenRouter.

3
00:00:16.687 --> 00:00:27.231
Pick one and paste your own API key. You pay the provider directly, at their prices.

4
00:00:27.232 --> 00:00:36.232
With Remember between sessions on, it keeps lasting facts about your book, so you don't repeat yourself.

5
00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:41.722
Now ask about the chapter you have open, or pick a starting point like Check consistency.

6
00:00:45.764 --> 00:00:52.265
It reads the chapter with you and answers in a few seconds.

7
00:00:52.268 --> 00:00:58.868
Ask follow-ups, or for a new draft of a paragraph. Nothing changes in your book unless you put it there.
